          su7A6EndpointSourceRightCodeOf R0.source_label <
        2 * n := by
    simpa [R0, hleftRead, hrightRead] using hbelowCell
  simpa [R0, hheight] using
    su7A6EndpointLeftAnchorCompletionTarget_sourceOrientedSameSpectrumProjectionCore_of_sourceBelow_and_rightCheck
      A hpos Hright Hbelow

/-- Early local copy of the finite checker for endpoint code `11`.

The general audit theorem `natMultiplicativelyAtomicCheck_eleven` is introduced
later with the finite examples.  This local source/phase theorem needs the
same fact before that block, so it keeps the finite proof next to the
right-anchor source-generation cut. -/
theorem natMultiplicativelyAtomicCheck_eleven_for_leftAnchorSourcePhase :
    natMultiplicativelyAtomicCheck 11 = true := by
  unfold natMultiplicativelyAtomicCheck natHasNontrivialDivisorCheck
