/-- Local five-seven source/readout version of the left-anchor source core.

For the hard `(n=10,left=5,energy=8)` under-target source, the right-anchor
Boolean check is recovered from the residual-energy readout, so the
source/projection core no longer takes `rightWeightCode = 7` or a pointwise
