/-- With canonical `-19` center disposition, the P948 adaptive target is
generated by the exact bound-`5` raw endpoint predicate.

This is still an upstream finite readout theorem: it records what the
representation grammar must materialize after producing the `-19` disposition,
without invoking coverage, P950, or a repair-cell adapter. -/
theorem p948_targetCell_exactBoundFiveAllowed_of_canonicalCenterShift_neg19
    (L : SU7A6ProducedActiveRawCellCompletionTargetLaw σ hσ 6 3)
    (A : SU7ProducedActiveCell σ hσ 6 3)
    (hleft : A.sourceCell.cell.leftWeightCode = 3)
    (hright : A.sourceCell.cell.rightWeightCode = 3)
    (hpos : A.energy ≠ 0)
    (hshift :
      su7A6CenterCoverShiftOfDisplacement
        (su7A6ConcreteEndpointSourceReadout A).source_label
        (L.targetLabel A hpos) = -19) :
